<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">October Manifesto</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1905">1905</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The October Manifesto was a declaration issued by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tsar">Tsar</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nicholas-ii">Nicholas II</a> in 1905 under pressure from revolution. It promised civil liberties and created the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/state-duma">State Duma</a> as an elected legislative assembly. It made the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a> a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constitutional-monarchy">constitutional monarchy</a> in name, though Nicholas consistently undermined the Duma's authority in practice.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/october-manifesto.jpg" alt="October Manifesto" width="320" height="173" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ilya Repin · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Repin_17October.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
